  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello.\n\nA few weeks ago I came across a bug with one of my my Avatars that caused its textures to flash in random colors when moving, but only for me and not for others. This however only happened on half the maps, not all. Not quite sure why yet.\nI just \"confirmed\" this with 2 other people that have the same issue as me.\nThe thing we have in common? A stray Vertice somewhere far off in the distance that caused us to create a boundary box around our Avatar so we could get it within size limits and upload it.\nSo the obvious culprit is either the boundary box in itself or the stray vertice(s)\n(Changing shaders doesnt do anything)\n\nEdit: Pictures!\n\nhttps://media.discordapp.net/attachments/386442337435254785/388970593279803393/20171209001147_1.jpg?width=655&height=625 <-- this aint supposed to be blue, the whole body gets the color, sometimes red, black, etc.",
